"steam-3727090","kind":"announcement","title":"Coming Soon: updated Demo for Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hey everyone, we have big news today: Horses of Hoofprint Bay will be participating in Steam Next Fest (Oct 19-26) with an updated Demo! What you need to know: 1️⃣The October Demo will remain limited to 25 days of playtime. 2️⃣The October Demo will more closely represent the first 25 days of the “actual” game: Due to the rebalancing we’ve done, that means you will start with a horse that has much lower stats, and you will most likely not be able to progress quite so far. 3️⃣The October Demo will","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T12:15:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067933120","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3727090-1841579228668508","game_id":"steam-3727090","kind":"announcement","title":"Out Now: Release Date Reveal Trailer","summary":"We’re thrilled to finally share the release date for Horses of Hoofprint Bay! See for yourself in our brand new Release Date Reveal Trailer right here: And so we don’t keep the information for anyone unable to watch a video right now: the game is scheduled to release on November 4th 2026! We still have plenty to do until then – from testing, balancing and bugfixing to adding and refining some additional content – but we are confident that we’ll have a good version of this game ready for you all ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T12:00:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228668508","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3727090-1840944183774273","game_id":"steam-3727090","kind":"update","title":"Desensitization, Horse Personalities and Cross Country Competitions – Dev Update","summary":"A ton of things have been happening behind the scenes of Horses of Hoofprint Bay, it's time for a round-up of some exciting new additions to the game that we haven't talked about yet. We did not want to confirm the inclusion of these features until we were sure we had the time and capacity to tackle them, but everything mentioned here has now been implemented and is currently being tested and balanced with the help of a small handful of beta testers. More testers will be added in the coming week","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T15:18:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183774273","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3727090-1834602721185388","game_id":"steam-3727090","kind":"announcement","title":"We’re in the Women-Led Games Showcase: Watch our Brand New Gameplay Trailer!","summary":"We’re thrilled to announce that Horses of Hoofprint Bay will be part of the Women-Led Games Showcase in Summer Games Fest 2026 with a brand new gameplay trailer! You’ll be able to watch the Showcase stream right here on the YouTube Channel of The Game Awards! 😍The Showcase will begin on June 4th at 4PM PT | 7PM ET | 1AM CET | 7AM CST. Following the Showcase, our Demo will also be featured in the Women-Led Games event on Steam, where you can check out a ton of cool games, from hot new announcemen","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-03T17:00:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721185388","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3727090-1833968530885914","game_id":"steam-3727090","kind":"update","title":"Beach Rides, Leopard Patterns and Staff Overhaul - Dev Update","summary":"Last week we announced that our Beta Playtests are slowly kicking off now and we already got so many signups that we can only add a tiny portion of applicants! So now we want to show some of the exciting feature and content additions we've been working on to all of you here, at least! Note that these additions won't make it to the Demo, but they'll be available for everyone in the full game at release later this year. Without further ado, here's some cool stuff we've been making: Leopard Pattern","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-27T16:23:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530885914","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3727090-1833334318571563","game_id":"steam-3727090","kind":"announcement","title":"Beta Playtest Registration now open!","summary":"You can now sign up as a Beta Playtester on our Steam Page right here! Note that even if you’ve registered for our Alpha Playtest in December-January, you will need to apply again, since we’re starting with a fresh pool of applicants and are giving everyone a new chance to get selected.FAQWhat does the Beta Playtest entail? The Beta Playtest version represents the “full” version of the game as it currently exists, though of course it is not finished yet. Compared to the Demo, the Beta Playtest a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-22T12:24:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318571563","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3727090-1827626365758339","game_id":"steam-3727090","kind":"announcement","title":"Insights, Release Timeline, Playtesting Plans and More!","summary":"Lovely people, it's been a few very exciting weeks for us at thogli studios and The Mane Quest, and we want to give you a few updates! Demo ReceptionThe Demo for Horses of Hoofprint Bay has been out for a bit over a month now, and we could not be happier with how it's going. We've received a ton of lovely feedback and praise, as well as a lot of useful pointers and minor reports that will let us improve the game in the future. Some numbers that we're particularly proud of: Our demo has been play","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-20T16:34:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365758339","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3727090-1826992588604664","game_id":"steam-3727090","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Patch Notes v0.1.10/v0.1.11/v0.1.12","summary":"Here are some more fixes, improvements and even some small new features for the Demo! Notable Changes - New boots for the horse! - Lesson tutorial skipable - Richt click to zoom out yard overview - Filter and sort horses at the breeder's sales stable - Daily Activities in the office now have a much nicer layout Full Changelog for v0.1.10 Features & Improvements - Added new open front and tendon boots. - Removed purple boots. - Leg protection graphics update. - Lesson tutorial skipable. - Scritch","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-17T17:26:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588604664","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3727090-1825727806706245","game_id":"steam-3727090","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Patch Notes v0.1.9","summary":"A nasty bug snuck into the last update... Lessons are fixed now!Changelog v0.1.9Bugfixes- Fixed: Can't start lessons in a freshly installed game.- Fixed: Impossible times by competitors in Competition Low.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-26T00:33:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825727806706245","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3727090-1825727806705276","game_id":"steam-3727090","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Patch Notes v0.1.8","summary":"We made a week-one update for the demo to fix some issues and add improvements!Notable Changes- More settings available, like disabling sounds and some accessibility, e.g. zoom in lessons.- Balancing, e.g. exercise cost for training courses.- Pause riding and lessons on Esc.- Horses can be switched between full stable groups.- More QoL stuff.- A lot of bugfixes.Full Changelog for v0.1.6Improvements- Fade out music when course ends.- Adjusted volume for \"wrong correction sound\" in lessons.- Chang","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-25T16:30:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825727806705276","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3727090-1824644522845746","game_id":"steam-3727090","kind":"announcement","title":"Horses of Hoofprint Bay: Demo OUT NOW!","summary":"Good News, everyone! A free demo version of Horses of Hoofprint Bay is now available on Steam!Play the Demo right hereThe demo version includes 25 in-game rounds of playtime, which should give you a chance to try out horse care, training, giving riding lessons, riding competitions, upgrading some buildings and even breeding your first foal or two!New Visuals and FeaturesSince our initial announcement, we've added an updated a whole bunch of our visuals, and added music and sound effects to the g","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-16T16:12:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1824644522845746","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3727090-1818118366170460","game_id":"steam-3727090","kind":"announcement","title":"Our Playtester Registration is now open!","summary":"Good News: We will start conducting playtests for Horses of Hoofprint Bay in the coming weeks!If you’re interested, head right over to our Store Page and hit that “Request Access” button for our Playtest. Please note that the game is still heavily work-in-progress and contains a lot of placeholder visuals. We recommend ONLY registering for Playtesting if you’re alright with playing an unfinished game and are actively interested in giving us feedback. In order to keep the feedback manageable, we ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-03T15:09:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818118366170460","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3727090-1815580768425100","game_id":"steam-3727090","kind":"announcement","title":"We're part of Steam's Animal Fest this week!","summary":"Steam is celebrating all kinds of critters this week, with Animal Fest, a sale event dedicated to games about animals and games with animal protagonists. We are stoked to be part of the line-up with Horses of Hoofprint Bay, in the section for Popular Upcoming games! If you need horse game recommendations to tide you over until Playtesting for Horses of Hoofprint Bay becomes available, we recommend checking out these other horse games currently on discount in the Animal Sale: If you're looking fo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-11T13:22